<title>ROMANIA: Minor tremor shakes eastern Romania.</title>
<headline>Minor tremor shakes eastern Romania.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A minor earthquake shook eastern Romania on Thursday, but no damage was reported,the state news agency Rompres said.</p>
<p>Rompres said the tremor, measuring 3.9  degrees on the Richter open-ended scale, occured at 5.44 p.m. local (1444 GMT) in the mountain region of Vrancea, 300 km (190 miles) northeast of the capital.</p>
<p>It said the tremor was not felt in Bucharest.</p>
